{"type":"message","id":"74243bf3","parentId":"b1771927","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:00:25.386Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 2:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 02:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778896825284}}
{"type":"message","id":"3aca909b","parentId":"74243bf3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T02:00:33.814Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to perform a heartbeat check on the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. I need to:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read and respond\n4. POST /send messages to the corresponding thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me fetch both histories simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-0472c441-6299-482b-adb7-1cfd9a9348e5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-47ce9611-ee42-4cff-b9fa-bfac9d089dac","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":243,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11366,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778896825386,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8bc3825b-0461-483a-b256-9ce09cef39dd"}}
